<section
  id="how-it-works"
  class="how-it-works-overview"
>
  <div class="site-container">

    <div class="how-it-works-overview__intro">

      <p class="how-it-works-overview__label">
        How It Works
      </p>

      <h2>
        From sourcing requirement to commercial options.
      </h2>

      <p>
        PACTSOL follows a practical sourcing process designed to help
        businesses communicate requirements clearly, obtain relevant supply
        options, and review available commercial information before deciding
        how to proceed.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="how-it-works-overview__steps">

      <article>
        <span>01</span>

        <h3>
          Share your requirement
        </h3>

        <p>
          Tell us what you need, including the product specification,
          quantity, delivery location, and required timeline.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>

        <h3>
          Requirement review
        </h3>

        <p>
          PACTSOL reviews the information provided and seeks clarification
          where necessary before approaching suitable supply sources.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>

        <h3>
          Supplier coordination
        </h3>

        <p>
          Relevant manufacturers, distributors, or suppliers may be
          approached based on the requirement and available sourcing options.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>

        <h3>
          Commercial options
        </h3>

        <p>
          Available quotations and relevant commercial information are
          organized for customer review.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>05</span>

        <h3>
          Customer decision
        </h3>

        <p>
          The customer evaluates the available options and remains responsible
          for supplier selection, commercial acceptance, and the final
          purchasing decision.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="how-it-works-overview__footer">

      <a
  href="/request-quote"
  target="_blank"
  rel="noopener noreferrer"
>
  Request a Quote →
</a>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>




